
  1. [1m[38;5;153mminLength[39m and [38;5;153memail[39m skip empty values[0m — so a blank required-and-email field reports "is required" rather than "is
     not a valid email". Deliberate, but it's a judgment call you may want the other way.
  2. [1mThe [38;5;153mfile://[39m regression[0m — switching [38;5;153mindex.html[39m to [38;5;153mtype="module"[39m means double-clicking the file stops working; you'll
     need a local server. It's the one user-visible cost of the ES-module decision.
